      "shortName": "plugin-task-ui-1",
      "title": "plugin-task-ui-1 — ViewNode model + PropValue + Intent",
      "status": "done",
      "description": "ViewNode { kind, props, events, children } (events press/change) + PropValue (scalars + semantic enums ViewSize/ViewVariant/ViewAlign, colors/glyphs as names) + Intent(action id + args), all serde-serializable (JSON round-trip test = WASM-ready). WidgetKind covers the WHOLE grid-ui vocabulary (containers + ItemGroup/DockFrame/MarkerGroup/Tabs + all leaves). Behaviour is Intent-only (no closures) so it stays serializable for native AND plugin/WASM. Files: heca/src/chrome/view.rs.",
