    {
      "id": "fc199765-dfbe-4c2a-99b4-e3a64cf49686",
      "phaseId": "99d19246-1ba9-4720-9895-e70c66acf144",
      "number": 5,
      "shortName": "plugin-task-ui-4",
      "title": "plugin-task-ui-4 — Dialog widget + rich modal bodies",
      "status": "in-progress",
      "description": "LARGELY DONE for the modal case: added heca-grid-ui::Dialog (real body + real action Button children; scrim/centering/focus-trap; self-contained keyboard). OverlayHost::open_modal takes ModalSpec { title, body: ViewNode, actions }, realizes the body via realize, builds it into a Dialog layer. Showcase demo + docs/widgets.md §Dialog added.\n\n## Progress 2026-07-15 (scoped against code)\nForm marshalling was ALREADY wired for Input/Toggle/Checkbox: interaction.rs:673 `collect_overlay_form` → `ModalResult::Action{data}` on SubmitOverlay. The ONE gap was Select.\n\nDONE this session (branch feat/action-task-c, awaiting commit approval):\n- realize.rs: named `Select` now marshals its CHOSEN OPTION VALUE (not index) into form data — new `option_values(node)` helper + reader over `select.state()` index → value.\n- overlay.rs: fixed stale `ModalResult::Action` doc (Input→Text, Toggle/Checkbox→Bool, Select→Text).\n- Tests: `named_select_is_collected_as_its_chosen_value` + `rich_modal_body_marshals_every_named_field`. All suites green, clippy 0 (only pre-existing block v0.1.6 dep note).\n- docs/widgets.md: §Dialog modal-from-data prose+example add Select field; §Select notes `name` opts into form submission.\n- showcase.rs: Dialog demo body enriched to a NON-overlay rich form (Label + Input + Checkbox) — deliberately not nesting a Select (see BUG A in T009).\n\nREGRESSIONS FOUND + HANDLED (moved to T009, NOT T005):\n- BUG A (nested Select inside Dialog: z-order show-through + hover fall-through) → documented in T009.\n- BUG B (Dialog off-screen when mounted in-flow in the scrolled showcase). Attempted a widget fix (Dialog::on_layout viewport-recenter) — it REGRESSED (still off-screen + backdrop-but-no-panel on re-open because showcase bounds are in scrolled-tree coords, not screen coords) so it was REVERTED. Dialog restored to taffy-only centering (correct in the app). Full analysis + correct approach in T009 BUG B.\n- BUG C (showcase has no horizontal scrollbar; ScrollRegion is vertical-only) → noted in T009.\n\nREMAINING for T005: none functional — the marshalling deliverable is complete and tested. Table = T007. Ready to mark done after user commit approval.",
